{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30807","headline":"寄贾岛 · 马戴","name":"寄贾岛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海上不同来，关中俱久住。\n寻思别山日，老尽经行树。\n志业人未闻，时光鸟空度。\n风悲汉苑秋，雨滴秦城暮。\n佩玉与锵金，非亲亦非故。\n朱颜枉自毁，明代空相遇。\n岁晏各能归，心知旧歧路。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30807.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30807","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}